1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,200
一只小笼包，顶上18个褶
18 folds on one soup dumpling

2
00:00:02,200 --> 00:00:04,300
少一个，就不算南翔
Fewer, and it's not Nanxiang

3
00:00:04,300 --> 00:00:06,500
8克皮，包14克馅
8g skin wraps 14g filling

4
00:00:06,500 --> 00:00:08,600
皮薄得能透光
The skin lets light through

5
00:00:08,600 --> 00:00:10,700
馅里藏一块皮冻
A cube of jelly hides inside

6
00:00:10,700 --> 00:00:12,800
一蒸，冻就化成汤
Steam it — the jelly melts to soup

7
00:00:12,800 --> 00:00:15,000
旺火五分钟，汤锁在里面
Five minutes, soup sealed within

8
00:00:15,000 --> 00:00:17,100
别急着咬，先开个小口
Don't bite — open a small hole first

9
00:00:17,100 --> 00:00:19,200
先嘬汤，再吃包
Sip the soup, then eat the rest

10
00:00:19,200 --> 00:00:21,400
这捏褶，是上海的非遗
These folds are Shanghai heritage

11
00:00:21,400 --> 00:00:23,600
18个褶，你数得清吗？
18 folds — can you count them?

12
00:00:23,600 --> 00:00:26,000
下集：一碗汤，不冒热气却烫嘴
Next: a soup that burns without steam
